{"3194420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Coffee Masters! - Multiplayer Cafe Simulator", "steam_appid": 3194420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4826950], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the place where the smell of coffee meets chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to 4 players in this multiplayer cafe simulator where teamwork, speed, and coordination are the keys to success. Run your own cafe, prepare coffee orders, serve demanding customers, survive intense rush hours, and grow your business together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work Together in Chaotic Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign roles, coordinate with your team, and keep the cafe running under pressure. One player can prepare drinks while another handles serving, cleaning, or take-away orders. Communication and teamwork are essential during peak hours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running a successful cafe requires communication and teamwork. Assign roles with your friends, coordinate during rush hours, and keep the cafe operating smoothly while handling growing customer demands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194420/extras/7124a29d8f68239ed01ed72fd6dce506.poster.avif?t=1781522677\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194420/extras/7124a29d8f68239ed01ed72fd6dce506.webm?t=1781522677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194420/extras/7124a29d8f68239ed01ed72fd6dce506.mp4?t=1781522677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Design and Run Your Dream Cafe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Create and customize your own cafe with different furniture, decorations, and equipment. Expand your workspace, improve your workflow, and build a cafe that can handle increasingly busy customer traffic. <br>  <br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194420/extras/9998dd20c0e2e9e9391de08645e6f27d.poster.avif?t=1781522677\" width=616 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194420/extras/9998dd20c0e2e9e9391de08645e6f27d.webm?t=1781522677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194420/extras/9998dd20c0e2e9e9391de08645e6f27d.mp4?t=1781522677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hone Your Barista Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> </strong>Master the art of coffee preparation with different recipes and interactive coffee-making mechanics. Prepare espresso, steam milk, serve hot or cold drinks, and improve your speed and precision under pressure.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194420/extras/fdf5f3701934ba93dce35f192e8f3d55.poster.avif?t=1781522677\" width=616 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194420/extras/fdf5f3701934ba93dce35f192e8f3d55.webm?t=1781522677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194420/extras/fdf5f3701934ba93dce35f192e8f3d55.mp4?t=1781522677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Balance Speed and Customer Satisfaction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customer traffic changes throughout the day. Calm mornings can quickly turn into intense rush hours with long queues, complex orders, take-away customers, and increasing pressure on your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve orders quickly and correctly to earn popularity, experience points, tips, and better rewards. Mistakes, delays, and burned orders can slow your progress and create chaos inside the cafe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Market Prices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!!! Your <strong>Reliability Status</strong> influences the deals you get from suppliers. Maintain high reliability to secure the best prices, or face higher costs if trust falters, adding a strategic layer to managing your cafe’s finances :). !!! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194420/extras/24771ff57e89ceb8ac7a0ec931cec717.poster.avif?t=1781522677\" width=616 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194420/extras/24771ff57e89ceb8ac7a0ec931cec717.webm?t=1781522677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194420/extras/24771ff57e89ceb8ac7a0ec931cec717.mp4?t=1781522677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Balance Prices and Manage Customer Satisfaction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Set prices that keep customers happy and sustain your cafe’s growth. Your reliability status plays a role in customer loyalty and supplier prices, so each decision matters.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194420/extras/701ab3dd4adaa13635ef745b2f73d030.poster.avif?t=1781522677\" width=616 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194420/extras/701ab3dd4adaa13635ef745b2f73d030.webm?t=1781522677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194420/extras/701ab3dd4adaa13635ef745b2f73d030.mp4?t=1781522677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hire and Build a Loyal Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>As your cafe grows, hire baristas and waitstaff to support your business. Each team member brings unique skills, so choose carefully to create an efficient, inviting atmosphere for customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194420/extras/03242742b0b383fd1cef64e3e7fb619a.poster.avif?t=1781522677\" width=616 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194420/extras/03242742b0b383fd1cef64e3e7fb619a.webm?t=1781522677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194420/extras/03242742b0b383fd1cef64e3e7fb619a.mp4?t=1781522677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join Barista Contests and Special Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in barista contests and special cafe events where players can compete in different coffee-making challenges, test their skills, and earn unique rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't forget to:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194420/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1781522677\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/